This is a placeholder for the default Desify Open Graph image.

Please replace this file with an actual image file (JPG format) that will be used when listings/events/threads don't have their own images.

Recommended specifications:
- Dimensions: 1200x630 pixels
- Format: JPG
- File size: Under 1MB
- Content: Desify logo/branding with tagline "Buy and sell items on Desify"

The image should be visually appealing when shared on social media platforms like WhatsApp, Facebook, and Twitter.